{d}x]\\,\\text{d}A\n$$\n\nIn our case, we have\n\n$$\n{u}_{1}(y,z)=-2y-1,\\,{u}_{2}(y,z)={y}^{2}+2z.\n$$\n\nTherefore, our triple integral can be written as\n\n$$\n{∭}_{R}f(x,y,z)\\,\\text{d}V={∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{-2y-1}^{{y}^{2}+2z}f(x,y,z)\\,dx]dA.\n$$\n\nNow, the region $D$ is given by\n\n$$\nD={(x,y)\\,:\\,-8\\le y\\le {sin}^{2}⁡z,\\,0\\le z\\le \\pi }.\n$$\n\nTherefore, by expressing the double integral over $D$ as a repeated integral, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{D}[{\\int }_{-2y-1}^{{y}^{2}+2z}f(x,y,z)\\,dx]dA & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{-8}^{{sin}^{2}⁡z}[{\\int }_{-2y-1}^{{y}^{2}+2z}f(x,y,z)\\,dx]dy\\,\\text{d}z \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{-8}^{{sin}^{2}⁡z}{\\int }_{-2y-1}^{{y}^{2}+2z}f(x,y,z)\\,dx\\,dy\\,dz.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, \n\n$$\na+b=0+\\pi =\\pi .\n$$" 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345815 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345816 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345817 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345818 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1000 #edb/ref 17592186345819 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1041 "selection" 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1104 #edb/ref 17592186345817 13194139535361 true] [17592186345814 1110 #uuid "07b7ce3a-2397-54f6-a2d3-f73cacc91ccb" 13194139535361 true] [17592186345815 1034 "{y}^{2}+2z-2y" 13194139535361 true] [17592186345815 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535361 true] [17592186345815 1111 #uuid "6a52495d-c609-55ee-84e8-757277db0d93" 13194139535361 true] [17592186345816 1034 "{sin}^{2}⁡z-8" 13194139535361 true] [17592186345816 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535361 true] [17592186345816 1111 #uuid "561d8166-9d56-5672-8862-d9a312ad1674" 13194139535361 true] [17592186345817 1034 "\\pi " 13194139535361 true] [17592186345817 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535361 true] [17592186345817 1111 #uuid "37